Recently, the market expectations show that the international community generally looks forward to China's future development.
“Hugo Rios, a well-known Chinese issues expert in Spain and honorary advisor of China Policy Observation Network, recently said in an interview with this newspaper that China’s epidemic prevention and control has entered a new stage, and the vitality of economic and social development will be further released.
Liuos said that in the face of various unexpected factors, China has calmly dealt with them with its outstanding economic governance experience and measures, which fully reflects its economic resilience and management level.
China is firmly committed to expanding its opening up to the outside world while the internal driving force of economic development is continuously strengthened, and state-owned enterprises and private enterprises develop in tandem.
Every year, the National Two Sessions are held in China, and the delegates discuss the development of the country and hot topics about people’s livelihoods. They gather consensus, unite people’s hearts and minds, and gather wisdom, which add power to China’s development.
“Since the reform and opening up, China has achieved long-term high-speed development, and has now entered the stage of high-quality development.
The international community is looking forward to China's wisdom and China's plan, and is looking forward to China's development to bring new opportunities to the world.
"Li said that China is currently making every effort to promote scientific and technological innovation, inject new impetus into economic and social development, and "investment, talent training, and policy incentives have made China continue to be full of vitality in the new five-year plan,"" he said.
For Reos, economic system reform is a daunting task for any country.
Under the leadership of the Chinese Communist Party, China has played the advantages of the market economy and the superiority of the socialist system, and has taken proactive measures to stabilize the economy.
Around the strategic base of expanding domestic demand, China will strengthen financial support for the real economy, support the development of private enterprises, small and medium-sized enterprises and manufacturing industry, insist on innovative development, promote employment, improve the income and living standards of the Chinese people, and meet the diverse and multi-layered consumption needs of the people. China will fully, accurately and comprehensively implement the new development concept, focus on promoting high-quality development, build a new development pattern, and bring more growth opportunities to the world.
