Fitness industry should get rid of trust crisis - chinanews.com
Another large gym “bankruptcy”?
Recently, the issue of protecting the rights of members of a well-known fitness institution, Zhongxin Fitness, has attracted social attention.
After the Spring Festival, many members found that their stores were not operating normally. Subsequently, rumors about the agency going bankrupt and running away caused members to panic, leading to the involvement of public security and social welfare departments.
Finally, the relevant person in charge of the agency came forward to respond, promising to strive to safeguard the legitimate rights and interests of employees and members, and the storm was finally calmed down.
Some fitness institutions have temporarily closed some of their branches due to operational problems. Consumers could have waited for the problems to be solved calmly. Why did many members' first reaction be "something is wrong"?
The fitness club member's legal battle is a deep-seated problem of industry trust crisis.
In China, traditional gyms generally adopt a prepaid payment model, and “making money from users who don’t come” is the underlying logic of its development.
By obtaining cash flow through pre-sale of membership cards and opening new stores, it seems that the cycle can be repeated, but in fact, it is eating the rice of the other, and it is impossible to form a stable profit model.
The frequent negative news of gyms and other industries closing down has a strong impact on consumer confidence.
From the market prospect, gyms are certainly a good business with “money making” potential.
The fitness track has been up and down, but it has always been the focus of capital.
According to various data, the popularity of sports and cultural consumption has been increasing, and the market has been recovering steadily.
Specifically in the fitness market, with the steady improvement of residents’ living standards, the concept of healthy living has entered people’s hearts, and the fitness industry has great potential for development.
The better the situation, the more the industry needs to pay attention to the quality of development.
However, some institutions are overly optimistic about the fitness market after the recovery of consumption, and just after coming out of the crisis, they are blowing the horn of expanding the market and investing all the funds in the construction of new stores.
It is undeniable that in recent years, many institutions have withdrawn due to the epidemic, and the industry has undergone a reshuffle. At this time, powerful enterprises choose to increase the acquisition intensity and reorganize, which is a new opportunity.
However, in order to develop into a virtuous cycle and move towards a prosperous future, the fitness industry must change its traditional model and business strategy.
Only by standing firm and rebuilding consumers' confidence and sense of security can we truly win the market and win the future.
Compared to the market capture of Big Health Club, the fitness industry currently needs to calm down and optimize services, and stabilize users with high-quality development.
First, we need to rely on services to retain users.
Gyms belong to the service industry, and their essence is to adhere to “user orientation”. They should focus on the needs of users and improve the quality of services.
Secondly, digital transformation is necessary to improve user experience.
For example, the popular Internet fitness center model, which realizes pay-per-use and site selection for users.
At the same time, the effective utilization of body data and sports data can also meet the social needs and realize the complete service loop from online to offline.
Without private coaching and huge annual fees, users’ concerns about “running away” from gyms have been reduced, and their trust in gyms has been improved.
In addition, we should actively explore multiple business models.
Nowadays, sports consumption has moved from single service to scene consumption, and fitness clubs are expected to become a new entry point for consumption. Surrounding products such as sports supplements and fitness equipment required for exercise will become a new source of profit, providing consumers with more choices.
Jia Tianxia
Buy cheap and return the difference!
Nanjing Real Estate Market Reappears “Price Difference Compensation” - CNTV
According to a report by Yangzhou Evening News/Qiwei News, a journalist found out during an interview that the “protection agreement” which had not been seen for more than ten years had returned to the Nanjing real estate market. A property developer in the Nanjing New Area claimed to “pay for the difference” and offered a discount on other properties before the handover of the property, and the developer was willing to switch the property with the buyer and return the difference.
“Buy-back agreement” conditions are not few
The building is named as Poly Jiangzi Xi Yuntai, and the person who came to see the house, Mr. Sun, told the reporter that he found a “statement” when he visited the building last weekend.
The pictures he sent to reporters showed that the developer of the property promised that if the buyer purchased the property between February 1 and February 28, the developer would switch the property and return the difference if there was a better discount on other properties of the same type (limited to other unsold properties of the same floor plan, same building, same unit, and same property type).
Mr. Sun said that the real estate consultant said that this was actually a "price protection agreement", which was intended to reassure buyers that they did not have to worry about the developer reducing the price for a sale promotion, "Now I'm afraid that it will be reduced in price after I buy it. I don't have time to go to the sales office to make trouble. If I don't make trouble, I will feel relieved."
Many home buyers also believe that the “protection agreement” is a kind of “assurance” for home buyers, but the conditions are not low.
Ms. Zheng, who intends to buy a first-time home in Jiangbei, said that the properties with protection clause must be of the same type, in the same building and the same unit. There are not many properties for comparison, and the "threshold" is high.
Some home buyers also think that because of information asymmetry, the seller may give additional discounts, and it is not easy for buyers to “stand up for their rights”.
Whether it is possible to keep the buyers of the house is to be observed.
A reporter inquired about the property on Ningbo's online real estate website and found that the two buildings of the project, with a total of 252 units, were sold in November last year. The unit areas were 105 square meters, 114 square meters, and 129 square meters, and the selling price of fully furnished units was 39,843 yuan/square meter.
However, more than two months have passed, and the online real estate shows that the total number of unsold units in the project is currently 157 units, accounting for 62.3%, of which 128 units are in block 8, and the total number of unsold units is 113; 44 units are unsold in block 7, which has 124 units; the total number of transactions in the project is only 33 units, accounting for only 13%.
Market people introduced that "protection agreement" also appeared in Nanjing in 2008.
In August of that year, the Lushan West Garden in Heqing Road launched a "protection plan" to attract buyers. The specific content was "the company solemnly promises that if the discount range of the project is expanded within one year, the company will refund the difference to the old owners according to the difference."
In April 2011, nine properties in Nanjing also promised to “compensate for the difference” with a portion of their properties.
“The property market is recovering, and we need a ‘stimulant’ at this time. ”
"The 'protection agreement' is also one of the marketing methods of real estate companies," said Shen, a senior operator in the real estate industry in Nanjing.
He believed that developers now need more confidence than home buyers, and the launch of the “protection agreement” is actually to boost their confidence.
As for whether the buyers of the houses can stay, he said that it depends on the influence of multiple factors such as the control policies and the loan threshold, and it is still to be observed at present.
China's rescue team continues rescue operation in Turkey, 4 people trapped have been rescued - chinanews.com
China Rescue Team dispatched three operation teams and 45 rescuers to search and rescue in Turkey on February 10, and rescued one person who was trapped.
At the same time, two search and assessment teams were sent to assess and investigate the 15 buildings on Vodabashi Street.
As of now, a total of 4 people were rescued, 5 people were found dead, and life signs and risk assessment were conducted on 25 collapsed buildings.
The rescue team will adjust the rescue force scientifically according to the actual situation of the disaster area and the rescue scene, and continue to carry out rescue work in depth.
The rescue team obtained the information of the rescue request through various channels such as the embassy, local government, and the United Nations rescue organization, and verified it one by one through online inquiries and on-site searches.
Introduce the current rescue environment and the collapse of buildings to the Hong Kong Rescue Team in China, and jointly carry out search operations.
Currently, it is responsible for regional coordination (SSC5) jointly with Italian rescue team, and 3 members are dispatched to participate in the work of the Rescue Coordination Center of Region No. 5. Communication is carried out with Italian, British, Serbian, Slovakian, Omani and other rescue teams to learn about the rescue work of the United Nations rescue organization and rescue teams of various countries.
The rescue team continued to strengthen safety management and team protection, strengthen safety control at the rescue scene in accordance with the principle of "unified command, safety first", strengthen rescue work discipline requirements, and clearly state safety precautions.
Establish a system of continuous on-call duty and guard duty, and strengthen the security management of the camp.
The medical staff of the rescue team provides medical examination services for the team members every day, and strengthens the medical protection of key personnel. At present, all the members of the rescue team are in good health, and carry out disinfection in the camp.
After the self-supporting camp was established, the logistics support team set up 26 tents in four categories, including command and communication, equipment storage, medical washing and disinfection, living quarters, and dog houses, to ensure the safety of the rescue equipment on the scene.
Kim Jong-un and his daughter interacted intimately, while his wife was left out
(Combined report on 11th) North Korea held a military parade on the 8th evening to celebrate the 75th anniversary of its founding. The daughter of the leader Kim Jong-un, Kim Ju-ae, not only attended the ceremony, but also stood on the podium with her father.
On the 9th, the Korean official media released a video in which Kim Jong-un hugged his father, and they exchanged affectionate glances and whispered to each other several times. She gently held her father's cheek with her hands and even touched her father's chest. The interaction between father and daughter was broadcasted to the whole country.
However, the first lady, Liu Yandong, had to stand aside.
According to the reports of “Korea News” and other Korean media, on the 7th, Kim Jong-un and his wife Ri Sol-ju brought their daughter Kim Ju-ae to attend the official photo of the banquet. Not only did Kim Ju-ae sit in the C position in the middle of her parents, which is rare, but she also stood on the podium with Kim Jong-un during the military parade on the 75th anniversary of the founding of the army the next evening.
The Korean Central Television, a Korean official media, later released a film of the parade, revealing more scenes of deep father-daughter love.
Kim Jong-un looked at his daughter several times from the podium, and the two of them never stopped smiling. They also whispered to each other in their ears. Kim Jong-un's daughter held her father's cheeks with her hands for a while, and Kim Jong-un smiled back.
Other official media images also show that the master of gold, Ri Sol Ju, was touching her father's face while sitting on an indoor sofa; while walking with her father, she was touching his chest with her hand.
The first lady, Liu Xi, could only walk behind or sit beside him, and was always just a few steps away from her husband and daughter.
According to the Korean media, Kim Jong-un has been increasingly exposed in public since the first time he appeared in public after the test-firing of the Mars-17 missile on November 18, 2017. This is the fifth time he has appeared in an official setting in the past three months.
The North Korean official media used the highest honorifics such as beloved son and distinguished son when referring to Kim Jong-un. It also broadcasted the scene of Kim Jong-un repeatedly shouting his vow to die for the pure blood while looking down at the parade from the stand.
These signs make people outside doubt whether the master of love has been predetermined as the successor of the Kim regime. The Washington Post analyzed that "this is a signal that Kim Jong-un has pushed his daughter, who is in middle school, to the position of the successor"; however, there is also a view that such judgment is too early, and there are still possibilities in the situation that Kim Jong-un has a son under his knee.
Xinhua News Commentator: Promoting the modernization of China is a systematic project – four thoughts on deeply understanding the important speech of General Secretary Xi Jinping at the opening ceremony of the seminar on studying and implementing the spirit of the 20th CPC National Congress – chinanews.com
Xinhua News Agency Beijing February 11th Xinhua News Agency Beijing February 11th Title: Pushing forward the modernization of China is a systematic project – four thoughts on deeply understanding the important speech of General Secretary Xi Jinping at the opening ceremony of the seminar on studying and implementing the spirit of the 20th CPC National Congress
Xinhua News Commentator
“Advancing the modernization of China is a systematic project, which needs to be planned comprehensively, systematically and as a whole, and correctly handle the relationship between top-level design and practical exploration, strategy and tactics, adherence to the right path and innovation, efficiency and fairness, vitality and order, self-reliance and opening up, etc.
“In the opening ceremony of the Seminar on Learning and Implementing the Thought of Xi Jinping on Socialism with Chinese Characteristics in the New Era and the Spirit of the 20th CPC National Congress for the newly elected members of the CPC Central Committee, alternate members and provincial and ministerial leaders, Xi Jinping, the General Secretary, scientifically grasped the laws of modernization construction, and profoundly and systematically explained a series of major relationships that need to be handled in practice, providing a scientific methodology for us to vigorously promote the Chinese-style modernization.
The promotion of Chinese modernization involves various fields such as economy, politics, culture, society, and ecological civilization, and relates to the governance of the party, the country, and the military, as well as domestic and foreign policies, national defense, and so on. It is necessary to make systematic plans and be brave in innovation, and continuously achieve the overall promotion.
Conduct top-level design, which requires profound insight into the trend of world development, accurate grasp of the common wishes of the people, in-depth exploration of the laws of economic and social development, and make the planned and policy system designed reflect the time, grasp the laws, and be creative, so as to achieve the combination of near and far, the connection of top and bottom, and the coordination of contents.
Pushing forward the modernization of China is a venture of exploration, and there are many unknown areas that need to be dared to explore in practice, and drive the development of the industry through reform and innovation, and never be over-cautious.
Strategic issues are fundamental issues for a political party and a country.
To promote the modernization of China, we need to enhance the foresight of the strategy, to scientifically predict the future and lead the future; we need to enhance the overallness of the strategy, to focus on solving major problems that concern the prosperity and development of the party and the country, and to solve the problems that affect the whole body; we need to enhance the stability of the strategy, and once the strategy is formed, it should be persistently and unswervingly implemented.
To scientifically grasp the dialectical unity of strategy and tactics, organically combine the principle of strategy and the flexibility of tactics, be flexible and mobile, adapt to changes, and make decisions on the spot, grasp the strategic initiative in adapting to local conditions, taking advantage of opportunities, and following the trend.
The Chinese nation is a nation that is both upright and innovative.
Handle the relationship between upholding the essence and source of Chinese modernization and innovation, and both uphold the essence and source of Chinese modernization and the fundamental requirements and major principles of Chinese modernization, and ensure the correct direction of Chinese modernization, and also put innovation in a prominent position in the overall situation of national development, meet the requirements of the times, focus on solving major theoretical and practical problems, actively seek changes and innovation, and vigorously promote reform and innovation, continuously create new impetus and advantages for development, and fully unleash the creative vitality of the whole society.
Efficiency is an important basis for fairness, and fairness is a powerful guarantee for efficiency.
We are advancing modernization in the Chinese way, which requires creating higher efficiency than that of capitalism and effectively maintaining social fairness, and better achieving the balance between efficiency and fairness, and the coordination, unity and harmony between them.
By balancing efficiency and fairness, we will continuously achieve development for the people, development relying on the people, and development results shared by the people, so that the fruits of modernization will benefit more and more people in a more fair and equitable way.
To promote modernization in the Chinese way, we need to handle the relationship between vitality and order, and make society full of vitality and orderly.
It is necessary to coordinate the development and security, implement the overall national security concept, perfect the national security system, enhance the ability to safeguard national security, and firmly safeguard the security of the state power, system, ideology and security in key areas.
While considering more security factors in development, improving national security strength through development, using the development achievements to consolidate the foundation of national security, and creating a safe environment for economic and social development, we will continuously stimulate the vitality of development, realize high-quality development and high-level security, and achieve a good interaction between them.
To promote the modernization of China, we must not only stick to our own path, but also broaden our horizons and keep an open mind to the outside world, and continuously expand the breadth and depth of China's modernization.
We must insist on independence and self-reliance, insist on putting the development of the country and the nation in the starting point of our own strength, and insist on firmly holding the destiny of the development and progress of our country in our own hands.
We should continuously expand high-level opening-up to the outside world, participate deeply in the global industrial division of labor and cooperation, make good use of both domestic and international resources, expand the development space of Chinese modernization, and share development opportunities and create a better future in mutual benefit and win-win cooperation.
To go far, one must go alone.
Let us, under the strong leadership of the Party Central Committee with Comrade Xi Jinping as the core, and with the scientific guidance of Xi Jinping Thought on Socialism with Chinese Characteristics in the New Era, grasp the laws, work hard and spare no efforts, and correctly handle a series of major issues. We should fully exert our positive energy, proactiveness and creativity, and strive to make progress in the new journey of building a modern socialist country in all-round development, and continuously open up new horizons for the Chinese-style modernization.
The United States, Japan, and the Philippines have reached a consensus on defense against the CCP
On February 9, Philippine President Bongbong Marcos visited Japan and met with Prime Minister Shinzo Abe.
Both sides reached consensus on opposing the CCP's infringement on the South China Sea and the East China Sea. The leaders of the Philippines and Japan issued a joint statement after the meeting, saying that they would sign a trilateral defense agreement with the United States and conduct substantive defense exchanges to oppose the CCP's hegemonic policy.
According to Japanese media, Kishida wanted to help Japan and the Philippines establish policies for the Taiwan Strait crisis during this meeting.
In early January, Xiaomi visited China and signed a $20 billion agreement.
But after that, the relations between China and the Philippines not only did not improve, but rather deteriorated.
Earlier this month, the Philippines signed an agreement with the United States to open more bases to the US military to ensure security in the South China Sea.
The new base, located 300 kilometers from Taiwan, is the closest location to China.
If a crisis occurs in Taiwan, the US military may launch an operation from the base in the Philippines.
The Japanese media believes that Japan, South Korea, Taiwan, Australia and the Philippines have formed an axis with the United States, and have built an "anti-CCP arc" in the Western Pacific to promote regional cooperation.
China encourages higher birth rate by donating sperm to university
The Human Sperm Bank in Yunnan Province, China, issued a publicity on the 9th, inviting people with a college education or students to donate sperm, and those who donate 8 to 12 times can get a subsidy of 4,500 yuan.
According to Taiwanese media reports today, the message went viral on Weibo on the same day, and triggered the follow-up initiatives of many provinces and cities, including Zhejiang, Shaanxi, Hubei, Shandong and Beijing.
According to a report by the Free Times, China encourages university students to donate sperm.
The universities in different regions donate sperm. The threshold for donating sperm in Beijing is the highest. In addition to academic qualifications, the donor must be taller than 170 cm, have a good appearance, no obvious hair loss, and the degree of myopia cannot be higher than 600 degrees.
According to the report, the sperm bank of Yunnan Province pointed out that the donor could get a full set of male reproductive health examination, which is worth 1000 yuan, “especially the examination of sperm and chromosome, which most people have never done before, and it is of great significance to know their reproductive status”.
The conditions for sperm donors include a height of 165 cm or above, a college education or above, no color blindness, and no genetic diseases or infectious diseases.
According to the report, the Chinese Tianmu News quoted a publicity poster of the Sperm Bank of Shaanxi Province, which reads “Donate sperm for money, it is honorable”. It called on young people to donate sperm and encouraged netizens to forward the relevant messages “to let love spread”.
In Shaanxi Province, the price is higher than that in Yunnan. Qualified people can receive RMB 300 in cash each time, and those who complete a certain number of donations can receive RMB 5,000 subsidies.
The highest subsidy known at present is 5150 yuan, and it is in Beijing.
“Fund E account” has arrived: the CSRC authorized its development; all funds under the name of investors can be collected and queried - Economic Observation Network － a professional financial news website
The reporter Chen Ming of Economic Observer Network thinks that the complicated channels of fund purchase lead to the difficulty of collecting account information.
Always forgetting the “petty cash”?
The problems of the Kims will soon be solved.
On February 10, the CSRC announced that the “Fund E account” APP was available for download and open testing in various mobile application stores.
According to the introduction, the "Fund E account" provides a "one-stop" query service for personal investors to query the account and share information of public fund, aiming to solve the pain points of the industry, such as forgetting the account and querying complicatedly.
According to Wind data, as of the end of 2022, there were 156 public fund managers in China, managing fund assets of about 26 trillion yuan; there were 167 public fund share registration institutions, and 411 public fund sales institutions.
The system of accounting of each shareholder registration institution is independent, and there is no unified query channel in the industry.
According to industry insiders, at the end of 2021, China's fund investors exceeded 720 million, which means that half of the country's population invested in fund products.
Previously, investors needed to inquire about their purchase through different sales institutions. However, with the “Fund E account”, investors can inquire about all purchases made through all sales channels, and the holding of the fund is clear at a glance.
"Fund E Account" is an app.
According to the relevant documents, the “Fund E Account” APP is a mobile application developed and constructed by China Securities for the public fund industry, approved by the China Securities Regulatory Commission. It can provide investors with one-stop inquiry of off-exchange shareholding of all public fund products in the market.
Investors can conveniently and quickly grasp the holdings of off-exchange shares of all public fund products under the management of all fund managers through the "Fund E Account", which can greatly improve the efficiency of inquiries.
Specifically, the information that investors can inquire through "Fund E Account" includes: fund account information opened at all public fund managers, transaction account information opened at public fund sales institutions, and the off-exchange shareholding of products including publicly offered securities investment funds and asset management plans established and managed by securities companies, with no limit on the number of investors.
According to Liu Yicheng, the person in charge of the business of Shanghai Securities Fund Evaluation Research Center, investors can know the holdings of all their off-exchange public funds through the "Fund E Account" App, which helps them find "forgotten assets" and, more importantly, helps customers collect comprehensive information on their fund investment, which allows customers to grasp their investment situation more timely, accurate and complete, and thus better optimize their fund portfolio and plan their financial arrangements.
To register and use it, follow these steps:
Journalists noticed that the "Fund E Account" APP has been uploaded to the app stores of Huawei, Apple, Xiaomi, OPPO, and vivo, but the APP is still in the public trial operation stage. Investors need to fill in the invitation code to register, and investors can contact the fund management company they hold to get the invitation code.
A customer service person from a large Chinese public fund in Shanghai provided an invitation code with six digits to the reporter of Economic Observer, and told the reporter, “During the trial operation of the APP, China Clearing provides a certain number of invitation codes to each fund manager, and investors can get them by calling us.
After the trial operation is over, the invitation code will not be needed when opening the user registration.
“
Journalists registered and completed the query of the "fund E account" according to the relevant documents disclosed by the CSRC on its official website. The whole process only took a few minutes and mainly consisted of four steps: user registration, real name authentication, bonding of the fund account, and public fund query.
After the real name authentication, click the "Asset" fund binding button, and all the fund products purchased by the reporter through various fund sales platforms will be displayed in the binding option list (can bind account), and after binding, you can see the total assets of the fund you invested in and start using the query function.
It is worth noting that the “Fund E account” only provides inquiry services to investors and cannot be used for redemption and trading.
The data displayed in the "Fund E account" is generally the date three trading days before the date of the user's query (T day).
For example, on February 10, when you open the "Fund E account", the total assets, fund shares, and net value of the fund corresponding to the date will be pushed back three trading days, that is, February 7.
