In the end, the little lion, who had succeeded in human society, was lost, and he was no longer a complete lion or a complete human.
Finally, only the silhouette of the little lion is left, and I don't know where he went.
Maybe years later, the image of the little lion will remain in the memory of the grown-up little friend, and will be recalled by chance one day, perhaps touching or inspiring her.
