Amazon should not sell such products
Buy it when it is on sale, the price is not low, and the comments are also very good.
I was shocked when I received the product. The surface of the product was heavily damaged, and there were many other places with damages. It was either a fake or a used product. Here is the picture.
I applied for a return, and the person from the factory said it was caused by transportation, is that not true?
How could the goods be worn out inside?
There are only two possibilities: either it is a counterfeit or an old product, or I deliberately damaged the product and then took it back.
Objectively, I have no evidence to prove that I didn't damage the goods, but based on my shopping record on Amazon, I think such goods shouldn't appear in Amazon's self-sold goods. Customers choose Amazon's self-sold goods with trust, customer win, we win, customers' victory is the victory of manufacturers, and I hope everyone can work together to improve, thank you.
